<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">How does AEO differ from traditional SEO for B2B companies?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">AEO focuses on getting cited in AI-generated responses rather than ranking in search results. While SEO optimizes for clicks and page visits, AEO optimizes for inclusion in AI recommendations and synthesized answers that B2B buyers consume directly.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">Which AI engines should B2B marketers prioritize for AEO?</h3>
