</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">What type of content works best for B2B AEO optimization?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">Decision-stage content with specific data points, implementation guides, comparison frameworks, and authoritative industry insights perform best. Content must be citable with clear attribution and structured data markup for optimal AI engine recognition.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">How long does it take to see results from AEO implementation?</h3>
