</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">Can AEO work alongside existing SEO strategies?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">Yes, AEO complements existing SEO strategies by addressing AI-driven discovery channels while maintaining traditional search visibility. Companies can implement both approaches simultaneously to capture prospects across different research behaviors and platforms.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">What technical requirements are needed for effective AEO?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">Effective AEO requires structured data markup, proper schema implementation, authoritative content with clear attribution, and technical infrastructure that supports AI engine crawling and data extraction capabilities.</p>
</div>
</section>

